                "value": null,
                "duration": null,
                "durationMap": null,
                "chatType": 0
              },
              "content": "并认为是我们以前告诉她，\n喜欢这些东西……\n但实际上，这样的事没发生过。",
              "content_l10n": {
                "$type": "miHoYo.HYG.Localization.LocalizationString, Assembly-Common",
