                "value": null,
                "duration": null,
                "durationMap": null,
                "chatType": 0
              },
              "content": "嚯？珊瑚琴行的信，我看一眼……\n{A灵光一现}原来是这样！\n在下不才，猜测一下。",
              "content_l10n": {
                "$type": "miHoYo.HYG.Localization.LocalizationString, Assembly-Common",
                "textId": "Performance_204006701_152739495_content",
                "value": "嚯？珊瑚琴行的信，我看一眼……\n{A灵光一现}原来是这样！\n在下不才，猜测一下。",
                "duration": null,
                "durationMap": null,
                "chatType": 0
              },
              "nextRule": 0,
              "guardPeriod": 0.0,
              "desc": null,
              "voiceText": null,
