              "textGuid": 152739495
            },
            {
              "$type": "miHoYo.HYG.Performance.DialogCfg, Assembly-CSharp",
              "textId": 0,
              "pTimelineId": "",
              "speakerKey": "莫白",
              "voiceId": "",
              "fakeName": null,
              "fakeName_l10n": {
                "$type": "miHoYo.HYG.Localization.LocalizationString, Assembly-Common",
                "textId": "Performance_204006701_152739496_fakeName",
                "value": null,
                "duration": null,
                "durationMap": null,
                "chatType": 0
              },
              "content": "上次演唱会后，纳蕾娜的琴送修，\n这段时间缺少琴声帮她梳理记忆，\n所以将不同的人和事，错位记忆，出现混乱。",
              "content_l10n": {
                "$type": "miHoYo.HYG.Localization.LocalizationString, Assembly-Common",
                "textId": "Performance_204006701_152739496_content",
                "value": "上次演唱会后，纳蕾娜的琴送修，\n这段时间缺少琴声帮她梳理记忆，\n所以将不同的人和事，错位记忆，出现混乱。",
                "duration": null,
                "durationMap": null,
                "chatType": 0
              },
              "nextRule": 0,
              "guardPeriod": 0.0,
              "desc": null,
              "voiceText": null,
              "expressiveDesc": null,
              "textGuid": 152739496
            },
            {
              "$type": "miHoYo.HYG.Performance.DialogCfg, Assembly-CSharp",
              "textId": 0,
              "pTimelineId": "",
              "speakerKey": "莫白",
              "voiceId": "",
              "fakeName": null,
              "fakeName_l10n": {
                "$type": "miHoYo.HYG.Localization.LocalizationString, Assembly-Common",
                "textId": "Performance_204006701_152739497_fakeName",
                "value": null,
                "duration": null,
                "durationMap": null,
                "chatType": 0
              },
              "content": "修好琴一定可以帮到她！\n修琴的材料，星球上就有，\n但这个特殊贝壳……{短暂停}{A灵光一现}嚯嚯！想起来了。",
              "content_l10n": {
                "$type": "miHoYo.HYG.Localization.LocalizationString, Assembly-Common",
                "textId": "Performance_204006701_152739497_content",
                "value": "修好琴一定可以帮到她！\n修琴的材料，星球上就有，\n但这个特殊贝壳……{短暂停}{A灵光一现}嚯嚯！想起来了。",
                "duration": null,
                "durationMap": null,
                "chatType": 0
              },
              "nextRule": 0,
              "guardPeriod": 0.0,
              "desc": null,
              "voiceText": null,
              "expressiveDesc": null,
              "textGuid": 152739497
            },
            {
              "$type": "miHoYo.HYG.Performance.DialogCfg, Assembly-CSharp",
              "textId": 0,
              "pTimelineId": "",
              "speakerKey": "莫白",
              "voiceId": "",
              "fakeName": null,
              "fakeName_l10n": {
                "$type": "miHoYo.HYG.Localization.LocalizationString, Assembly-Common",
                "textId": "Performance_204006701_152739498_fakeName",
                "value": null,
                "duration": null,
                "durationMap": null,
                "chatType": 0
              },
              "content": "我记得，之前开演唱会的星屿，\n似乎就有这样的特殊贝壳，\n或许可以用来修里拉琴。",
              "content_l10n": {
                "$type": "miHoYo.HYG.Localization.LocalizationString, Assembly-Common",
                "textId": "Performance_204006701_152739498_content",
                "value": "我记得，之前开演唱会的星屿，\n似乎就有这样的特殊贝壳，\n或许可以用来修里拉琴。",
